  "body": "What changed:\n- The test `stock_fit_controls_follow_the_selected_shape` used `get_by_label(\"Delete\")`.\n- PR #2081 gave the ribbon cells AccessKit nodes. The ribbon Delete button now has the same label as the Stock page Delete button.\n- The lookup found two nodes and failed.\n- The new helper `stock_pane_delete` keeps only the Delete node in the Properties pane. It asserts that exactly one exists.\n- No assertion is removed. No label changes. No snapshot PNG changes.\n\nPinned by: `egui_app::tests::stock_fit::stock_fit_controls_follow_the_selected_shape`.\n\nReadings:\n- Before the fix: the test fails on `main` (4b7a6b1e8).\n- After the fix: the `stock_fit` tests in the ui lib and the ui `shell` binary pass.\n- Full `camcraft-ui` lib suite: 933 passed, 0 failed, 6 ignored.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\nNot exercised: other ui test binaries, the snapshot lane.\n\nChangelog: none\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #2170\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
